      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, here’s one that might work for you:\n\n\"Sure, I get the smell of doubts in the air, but it's never as potent as the aroma of guilt at a family reunion where you've got so many cousins, they can't even remember their own last names. But hey, at least the cilantro never comes with the chili in Mexico—those veneers are rarely given for generously sharing your least favorite holiday traditions.\"",
